# FastAPI

- Routers call services. Services call the database. Pydantic models are not ORM models.
- Return `{"detail": "...", "errors": [{"field": "...", "message": "..."}]}`.
- 422 validation, 404 missing patient or note, 400 rejected but well-formed input.
- Do not log note text, email, phone, or address.
- `GET /patients` accepts `search`, `status`, `sort`, `order`, `page`, `page_size`.
